  "prefLabel": "Lot 8103.01 Eligibility to offer ADW",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8103.01 Eligibility to offer ADW.\n\n(a) Except as provided in (b) below, no entity shall accept an ADW wager from a New Hampshire resident without a valid license issued by the commission to act as an ADW provider.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 284:22-c, VII, persons or entities that offered ADW services to New Hampshire residents as of July 1, 2022, may request permission from the commission to continue offering ADW services until January 1, 2026. If the person or entity has not obtained an ADW provider license by January 1, 2026, the provider shall cease operations until such a license is obtained.\n\nSource. #14448, eff 12-3-25, EXPIRES: 12-3-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot8100.html"
